Descriptions of scripts

I. M statistics analysis
i. collect the list of summary statistics to run M statistics
    00.get_mstat_list.sh
    00.run_mstat_list.sh
ii. run M statsitics
    01.run_m_stat.R
    01.run_m_stat.sh
    01.run_m_stat_noDHW.R
    01.run_m_stat_noDHW.sh
iii. run M regression
    02.m_regression.R

II. Meta-analysis. Run random-effect meta-analysis but use fixed-effects meta-analysis Pvalue. Weight by se rather than N.
i. template
    metal_BF_run_temple.txt
    metal_BF_run_temple.txt
    metal_BF_run_temple.txt
ii. generate meta-analysis scripts and run
    03.generate_random_metal_script.sh
    03.run_random_meta.sh
iii. check results
    04.check_meta_res.sh
    04.summary_meta_result_info.R
iv. select p<5e-8 meta0analysis results
    05.filter_sig_asso.sh
v. compare fixed-effect and random-effect meta-analysis result
    06.random_vs_fix.R

III. Generate lists for stage2 lists
i. select associations run by BF only (no threshold applied) (list 2)
    07a.filter_BF_only_asso.R
    07a.filter_BF_only_asso.sh
ii. select associations run by BF only + P<5e-8 in BF (list 1 part 1)
    07b.filter_BF_sig_only_asso.R
    07b.filter_BF_sig_only_asso.sh
iii. select associations surpassing Bonferroni threshold in >=1 method(s) & P<5e-8 in 3 methods (list 1 part 2)
    07c.filter_common_asso.R
    07c.filter_common_asso.sh
iv. generate lists
    08.generate_list1-3.sh
    
IV. Generate referece SNPs/CpGs involved in meta-analysis for further analysis (>=3 cohorts; >=10k samples)
    09.bg_snp_cpg_10ksample_3cohorts.R

V. Generate list 5
    10.observe_list5_cpgs.R 
